.SS "\fBHash64\fP SystemEx\&.Hash\&.CRC64\&.ComputeLong (FixedVector< byte > input, ulong seed)"

.PP
Computes a CRC‑64 checksum over the specified input buffer\&. If a non‑zero seed is provided, the computation is performed as a one‑shot operation\&. If the seed is zero, the computation continues from the internal rolling CRC‑64 state\&. This design allows CRC‑64 to operate in both streaming (rolling) and one‑shot modes without modifying the \fBIHash\fP pipeline\&. 
.PP
Implements \fBSystemEx\&.Hash\&.IHash\fP\&.
