.SS "ulong SystemEx\&.Hash\&.CRC64\&.RollingState\fR [get]\fP"

.PP
Gets the current rolling CRC‑64 state maintained across successive \fBComputeLong\fP calls\&. This value represents the intermediate checksum after all data processed so far\&. The rolling state allows CRC‑64 to operate in streaming mode without modifying the \fBIHash\fP pipeline interface\&.

.PP
If \fBComputeLong\fP is invoked with a seed value of zero, the computation continues from the existing rolling state\&. If a non‑zero seed is provided, the rolling state is replaced with the newly computed checksum\&.

.PP
This property exposes the internal CRC‑64 accumulator for diagnostic or pipeline‑level inspection, but does not alter hashing behavior\&. 
